{"title":"레인","artist":"SID","sourceId":"reference:nkWSLFb0wdhbnB5txKyZ","sourceHash":"5d474e58878f1fe5d4fad824aec06272993cd9ac120eb83fc4ecb088c4652472","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":4365027,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":21.64,"end":28.09,"text":"六月の嘘 目の前の本当","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":28.09,"end":32.69,"text":"セピアにしまいこみ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":32.69,"end":37.55,"text":"寄り添うとか 温もりとか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":37.55,"end":41.94,"text":"わからなくなってた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":41.94,"end":48.11,"text":"「君はひとりで平気だから... ね」と","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":48.11,"end":52.83,"text":"押しつけて さよなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":52.83,"end":62.16,"text":"その類の気休めなら 聞き飽きた筈なのに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":62.16,"end":68.35,"text":"鳴り止まない 容赦ない思い出たちは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":68.35,"end":73.25,"text":"許してくれそうにもない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":73.25,"end":78.5,"text":"目を閉じれば 勢いは増すばかりで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":78.5,"end":84.66,"text":"遠巻きで 君が笑う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":84.66,"end":90.4,"text":"雨は いつか止むのでしょうか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":90.4,"end":95.78999999999999,"text":"ずいぶん長い間 冷たい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":95.78999999999999,"end":100.75999999999999,"text":"雨は どうして僕を選ぶの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":100.75999999999999,"end":107.38,"text":"逃げ場のない 僕を選ぶの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":109.88,"end":116.17,"text":"やっと見つけた 新しい朝は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":116.17,"end":120.82,"text":"月日が邪魔をする","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":120.82,"end":125.82,"text":"向かう先は 「次」じゃなくて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":125.82,"end":130.97,"text":"「過」ばかり追いかけた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":130.97,"end":136.47,"text":"慰めから きっかけをくれた君と","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":136.47,"end":141.34,"text":"恨めしく 怖がりな僕","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":141.34,"end":144.76,"text":"そろそろかな 手探り","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":144.76,"end":151.11,"text":"疲れた頬を 葛藤がこぼれ落ちる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":151.11,"end":156.06,"text":"過去を知りたがらない瞳","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":156.06,"end":161.18,"text":"洗い流してくれる指","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":161.18,"end":166.56,"text":"優しい歩幅で 癒す傷跡","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":166.56,"end":173.24,"text":"届きそうで 届かない距離","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":191.75,"end":196.53,"text":"雨は いつか止むのでしょうか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":196.53,"end":201.74,"text":"ずいぶん長い間 冷たい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":201.74,"end":207.0,"text":"雨は どうして僕を選ぶの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":207.0,"end":212.07999999999998,"text":"包まれて いいかな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":212.07999999999998,"end":217.04,"text":"雨は 止むことを知らずに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":217.04,"end":221.99,"text":"今日も降り続くけれど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":221.99,"end":227.32999999999998,"text":"そっと 差し出した傘の中で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":227.32999999999998,"end":232.0,"text":"温もりに 寄り添いながら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}